window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>The hot stranger, who gate-crashed my party and almost came to blows with my boyfriend and my other lover, is my loathsome new stepbrother.<br> <br> Ares delights in telling me he’s named after the God of War, as he threatens to ruin me.<br> <br> Not sure what I have done to deserve his instant hatred, but whatever.<br> <br> Game on, ahole.<br> <br> Bring it.<br> <br> We are ready for you.</p> <p>This is a prequel short story to the Dirty Crazy Bad Duet by<b> </b><i>USA Today</i> and <i>Wall Street Journal</i><b> </b>best-selling author Siobhan Davis™. Originally published in the<b> </b>Nightingale<b> </b>charity anthology. Recommended to listeners 18 and over, due to mature scenes and content. This is a dark college reverse harem romance.</p>"; 
